                "text": "It was an honor to speak at @ZEROTOTHREE's Strolling Thunder Rally about my support for funding early childhood education and protecting Medicaid for the most vulnerable. Thank you for coming to DC to advocate for your families \u2013 there is nothing more important! https://t.co/Pk8ZgV1Esi",
