                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "President Trump left no doubt where he stands regarding Medicaid by reiterating his position. And I agree \u2014 we must strengthen the program for those it is intended to serve, and we do that by eliminating any waste, fraud, and abuse. I have been aligned with @POTUS on this issue and we need to act on it this week!",
