                "retweet_count": 36,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I just voted YES on H.R. 1 which will strengthen border security, cut taxes for working families and seniors, protect Medicaid for vulnerable individuals, and more.\n\n\ud83e\uddf5 Here\u2019s how:",
