                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "It protects Medicaid for our most vulnerable\u2014single moms, the disabled, the elderly, & the needy will continue to receive care.\n\nIt also roots out waste, fraud, & abuse by implementing stronger eligibility verification & work requirements for able-bodied adults w/ no dependents.",
