                "text": "BOTTOM LINE: H.R. 1 is about delivering results for Arizona and for America. From securing the border to cutting taxes and protecting vital programs like Medicaid, this bill puts hardworking Americans first and moves our country forward \u2705\ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8",
