                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "On Apr. 24, I joined the AZ delegation at @AZChamber\u2019s Capitol Hill Update, where I reaffirmed my commitment to protecting Medicaid and called for stronger oversight to reduce waste, fraud, and abuse.\n\nRead more: https://t.co/h7tsmeROQ5 https://t.co/ZacWsK48zV",
